OWLDoc incorporates source code from the Ontology Browser project:
https://github.com/co-ode-owl-plugins/ontology-browser
Source revision: c653faacd22128a22292ce8184ce510e0c0233f7

The ontology-management (owlmanager) and HTML-rendering/export (owlhtml)
packages are maintained as part of OWLDoc. The servlet-based owlbrowser module,
legacy bundled libraries, and logging configuration are not incorporated.

Original copyright and license notices are retained in the source files,
including University of Manchester / Nick Drummond notices and file-specific
LGPL or Mozilla Public License notices. Subsequent modernization and export
changes are recorded in the source project's history and the OWLDoc history.
OWLDoc's LGPL license text is included in META-INF/LICENSE; source artifacts
include the retained per-file notices. No binary Maven dependency on Ontology
Browser is required to build or run this plugin.
